  (text "Notes\nU8: event log and data logger (H3)\nR73: series, at the MCU\nU9: 128 KB FRAM (H2), I2C address 0x50. A1 = A2 = 0, WP low = writes enabled (pinout per datasheet)\nU10: 8 MB QSPI PSRAM on OCTOSPI1, up to about 100 MHz: keep it next to the MCU, traces under 30 mm and roughly matched\nC76: at U10 VDD\nR78: series, at the MCU\nR79: keeps the PSRAM deselected through reset\nJ4: RiBUS pinout from the RVT70HSBNWC00 V1.1A datasheet; 9-12 (GPIO, audio, QSPI) left open; 13-16 NC. CHECK contact side against the cable at"
    (at 15.24 137.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 241ef9e2-a9c2-521e-99a3-828a3b328048)
  )
  (text "\n    mechanical layout\nR76: series, at the MCU\nR77: series, at the MCU\nC72: at J4\nC73: at J4\nC74: at J4, backlight\nC75: at J4"
    (at 147.32 137.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 3b5905c6-055a-5312-8413-e8d55ca46ea5)
  )

